<TEXT OrsiInvitation Orsi_20_3_712.mp3 0>
<TITLE Orsi's Party Invitation>
<P 0xFFFFFFFF>
To My Many, Many, Many, Dear, Dear, Dear Friends,
<P 0xFFFFFFFF>
I would be honored beyond all telling should thou see fit to grace my exquisite mansion in the Western Ringstrasse with thy most splendid presence. We shall celebrate the upcoming solstice and the splendor of trade with foreign lands that hath so enriched Vienna. Come sample the finest drink in the land. I have the reddest of reds and the sweetest of nectars for thy refined palates. 
<P 0xFFFFFFFF>
Orsi the Magnificent
</TEXT>


